node_modules/
CLAUDE.md

# Local agent / editor state — this repo is public.
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
.env
.env.*

# store/ is the publishing workspace, and most of it is working material in the
# same sense CLAUDE.md is: listing copy, the launch plan, the asset generator
# and the build script. Two things in it are load-bearing on the public side
# and stay tracked:
#
#   PRIVACY.md — this exact path is the privacy policy URL registered on the
#                live Chrome Web Store listing. A 404 there is a required field
#                gone missing, not a broken link.
#   assets/    — the README renders its screenshots and donation QR codes from
#                here. (docs/ keeps its own copies, so the landing page does
#                not depend on this.)
#
# Ordering matters: store/* has to exclude entries individually, or git will
# not descend into store/assets/ to see the re-include below it.
store/*
!store/PRIVACY.md
!store/assets/
